  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niger Community Cohesion Initiative (NCCI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM aims to enhance the legitimacy and capacity of the Government of Niger, specifically at the village and commune level, and support state structures to deliver essential services and support to at-risk communities. This will increase the resilience and cohesion of communities in resisting conflict and instability, including threats of violent extremism. Components of this project include supporting improved communication by facilitating trust building between local authorities, community leaders, and communities through the creation and reinforcement of peace committees, as well as supporting local authorities in responding to security concerns at the community level.</narrative>
  </description>
